DESCRIPTION:Theatre\nhttps://ma.to/event/marie-antoinette-4k-restoration-2
 026-10-23\n\nThe Roxie marks twenty years since Sofia Coppola's Marie Ant
 oinette first reached screens with a new 4K restoration of the film. The 
 screening is presented as part of the cinema's anniversary programme alon
 gside Making Marie Antoinette\, Eleanor Coppola's posthumous documentary 
 offering a never-before-seen look behind the making of the film. Tickets 
 are available from the cinema.
